      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Legend\nPK = Primary Key   FK = Foreign Key   UQ = Unique index\nArrow labels show cardinality, requiredness, delete behavior, and role context.\nCurrent schema: all shown relationships are 1:N and mandatory on the FK side; there are no 1:1 relations.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Legend\nPK = Primary Key   FK = Foreign Key   UQ = Unique index\nArrow labels show cardinality, requiredness, delete behavior, and role context.\nCurrent schema: all shown relationships are 1:N and mandatory on the FK side; there are no 1:1 relations.",
