      "updated": 1781974200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Model notes\n\nNavigation collection properties are not database columns.\nString columns without explicit MaxLength map to nvarchar(max).\nAll FK properties shown are required by the current non-nullable CLR types.\nNo optional FK relationships are present in the current model.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Model notes\n\nNavigation collection properties are not database columns.\nString columns without explicit MaxLength map to nvarchar(max).\nAll FK properties shown are required by the current non-nullable CLR types.\nNo optional FK relationships are present in the current model.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 16
